            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(concentrate, occult, polymorph, transmutation)\n\nThe faceless stalker spends 10 minutes reshaping its appearance to take on the shape of any Small or Medium humanoid. It gains a +4 circumstance bonus to Deception checks to pass as that creature."
